:: Generator vent {"position":"2925,4400","size":"100,100"}
<<if visited () is 1>>\
The vent continued, sloping downwards until he came to another metal grill barring his way. He peered through and was surprised to see the inside of the large room he’d seen down in the basement. He got out his screwdriver and made to undo the fixing screws, but they were so rusted with age, the grill simply fell to the floor as soon as he touched it. He climbed out and dropped lithely down – then winced in pain as his body reminded him quite how bruised he was.

[[Examine the room|Geo Thermal]]
<<else>>\
