<<set $aidencomp to true>>\
<<if visited () is 1>>\
Aiden knew that this wasn’t a good use of his time, but he felt unsettled and just wanted to pretend that nothing was out of the ordinary. Perhaps if he played a game and ignored all this strangeness, Father would sort it all out?

He started the game and played on ‘Easy’ mode. Even then, his mind was elsewhere and he soon got overwhelmed. He quit the game in annoyance. He should stop putting it off – he had to go and find Vee!

<<else>>\
