<<if $fan2>>There was a breeze and a vibrating whir coming from somewhere<<else>>The air was still and quiet<</if>>. Eventually, he felt the space start to get wider and the echoing sounds of his progress changed. He felt around the metal walls. He seemed to be in a larger circular space, but the vent appeared to come to a dead-end.
