:: Trace [autosave] {"position":"4175,3400","size":"100,100"}
<<set $keyfound to true>>\
Aiden pulled the notepad from his back pocket, ripped out a page and placed it over the deep scratches in the wall. He grabbed the pencil and started to sketch lightly over the paper. After scrubbing back and forth for a while, several letters started to emerge.

He pulled the paper away and looked at it. It was definitely a word, but it didn’t make any sense? It simply read: <span id="write">debug</span>.

