She slumped against the wall, exhausted. Had she made a terrible mistake? Would Aiden be okay out there without her? As the minutes dragged by, she couldn’t help but worry about all the ways this plan might not work out so well. 

Then a strange thing happened. The voice rang out again.

<<set $vent to 30>><<set $mainvent to true>>\
<<set $fan1 to false>><<set $fan2 to false>><<set $fan3 to false>>\
