Aiden unplugged it from the wall and carefully undid the screws. He opened it up to find a mess of wires and charred plastic. It looked like the wires had eroded so much that it was impossible to tell what was supposed to go where. There was another thing in there too, but it was so blackened, he wasn’t sure what it was.

<<if $socket>>\
