However, he didn’t really know what he was doing. The inside was such a burned-out mess, he wasn’t sure which way round the wires went. He would just have to take a guess! Normally, that would have been enough; he would have taken the risk with no further thought. But tonight was different – tonight mattered. He couldn’t rely on Father to fix anything that went wrong.

[[Take a guess]]
<</if>>\

